/T (A Bachelor's graduate in Mathematics and Data Science from Universitas Andalas, specializing in Analysis and Geometry, equipped with a strong foundation in quantitative, conceptual, and analytical thinking. Technical competencies developed include data analysis and interpretation, mathematical modeling, algorithm development, as well as programming and data visualization. Problem-solving, leadership, cross-functional teamwork, and interpersonal communication skills have been honed through active involvement in various organizations and committees throughout university. Possesses a strong interest in risk analysis, financial management, and research, and is ready to be placed anywhere across Indonesia to contribute optimally. Committed to combining a data-driven approach with proven leadership skills to support strategic planning, risk management, and operational development within the company. )
